#!/bin/bash
cat <<EOF
================================================================================
Custom Red Hat UBI 9 S2I Builder Image
================================================================================

This builder image is used by OpenShift Source-to-Image (S2I) to build and run
web applications or lightweight Python microservices.

Usage with OpenShift CLI:
  oc new-app custom-s2i-builder~https://github.com/<your-repo>/<app-dir>

Usage with S2I command-line tool:
  s2i build <source-dir> custom-s2i-builder <output-image-name>

Required Contract:
  - Source code placed in /tmp/src during build.
  - Entrypoint script (app.py, server.py) or static HTML files (index.html).
  - Port 8080 exposed for unprivileged OpenShift containers.
================================================================================
EOF
